    {
      "id": 2,
      "name": "Queues and waiting times",
      "definition": "Visitor experiences with queues and waiting times for attractions, including crowd levels, fast-pass systems, and strategies to minimize waiting times.",
      "reviews": [
        "I recommend getting FastPasses for popular rides or you'll spend a lot of time waiting; even with FastPasses, we waited 15 minutes on some rides.",
        "We went on a fairly crowded day, but took advantage of FastPasses and single-rider lines, so we didn't spend the whole day in lines.",
        "On Monday, there were multiple rides with waiting times of nearly 90 minutes, but on Wednesday, even the most popular rides had waiting times of barely 30 minutes."
