    {
      "id": 3,
      "name": "Visit logistics and organization",
      "definition": "Practical aspects of planning and organizing park visits, including ticket purchases, accommodation, transportation, and park access.",
      "reviews": [
        "Highly recommend Hotel L'Elysée Val d'Europe for accommodation, the free Disney shuttle to and from the park, and also the Easy Go shuttle taxi service for travelling to and from the airport.",
        "We definitely recommend staying at one of the Disney properties: ease of entry, early morning access, charging privileges, and even package delivery to your hotel.",
        "I planned a 2-day, 1-night visit, booked my hotel room in advance at Disney's Hollywood Hotel, and took a taxi from Hong Kong on day 1."
