    {
      "id": 4,
      "name": "Staff service",
      "definition": "Visitor experiences with park staff, including their friendliness, helpfulness, communication, and quality of service.",
      "reviews": [
        "They have people directing foot traffic, yelling at guests about where to walk for no reason (I'd understand if there was something special going on in that area, but there generally never was); we felt like herded cattle.",
        "Due to knee surgery, I was in a Jazzy scooter on doctor's orders, and not once did a cast member make me feel uncomfortable or that I was an inconvenience.",
        "On one occasion, when we approached a member of staff to ask why we had been refused access to yet another ride, they lacked basic communication skills and seemed unwilling to help us with our questions."
