    {
      "id": 5,
      "name": "Disney entertainment and characters",
      "definition": "Disney entertainment activities, including shows, parades, fireworks displays, special events, and encounters with Disney characters.",
      "reviews": [
        "Don't miss out on the two indoor shows (Golden Mickeys and Festival of the Lion King), as well as the outdoor ones (Disney on Parade, Glow in the Park Halloween Parade, and Disney in the Stars fireworks).",
        "Kids get to trick or treat throughout the park, there's a special parade and fireworks show, and you get to meet characters dressed up in costume (or special characters like Jack Skellington who only come out for the event).",
        "Make sure you catch the Disney Parade at 3 pm, the Lights Parade at 7 pm, and the fireworks at Sleeping Beauty Castle at 8 pm."
